From 098f1a49568070d52645040f7eb7403e9463ae1f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 24 May 2026 19:47:49 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] Add cloud+local redundant data pipeline with AWS ingest
 server
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Split packet capture into two independent paths for maximum data safety:
- Pi keeps local MQTT listener (existing tinygs_mqtt.py, unchanged)
- AWS EC2 receives TinyGS webhook POSTs and roof groundstation uploads

New components:
- aws/ — FastAPI ingest server with dedup, beacon decoding, packet sync API
- compare.py — Pi-side reconciliation script merging AWS packets into local DB
- groundstation/ — Pluggable forwarder template for roof antenna (hardware TBD)

Core changes:
- packet_store.py: SHA-256 frame_hash column for dedup, store_packet_if_new(),
  packets_since() for sync, automatic migration for existing DBs
- db_backup.py: pre-backup AWS sync (--no-sync to skip), ensures local DB has
  all packets before snapshotting to SD card and Google Drive

